{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-variational","title":"数值方法与有限元","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/calculus-of-variations/practice/numerical-variational","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值方法与有限元\">数值方法与有限元</h1><p>前面所有篇章都在「解出」变分问题——旋轮线、悬链线、大圆弧。但这些漂亮的解析解是稀有的特例。真实工程里的变分问题，被积函数复杂、区域形状不规则、边界条件混合，几乎从不存在闭式解。怎么办？答案是放弃「精确解一个微分方程」，转而「在有限维子空间里逼近极值」。这条路从 Rayleigh 和 Ritz 在十九世纪末的想法出发，发展成今天科学与工程计算的绝对主力——有限元方法（FEM）。这一篇讲变分法如何落地成计算机能算的数值方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-rayleigh-ritz-把无穷维压成有限维\">核心概念：Rayleigh-Ritz 把无穷维压成有限维</h2><p>核心思想朴素得惊人。变分问题是在无穷维函数空间里找让泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J[y]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>；Rayleigh-Ritz 方法不在整个空间里找，只在一个有限维子空间里找。选一组基函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_1,\\dots,\\phi_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（满足本质边界条件），把试探解写成它们的线性组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_n(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^{n} c_i\\,\\phi_i(x).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入泛函，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J[y_n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 就成了关于系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_1,\\dots,c_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的普通多元函数。于是无穷维变分问题被压缩成一个有限维优化问题——令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial J/\\partial c_i=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，解一个（线性问题里是线性的）代数方程组即可。这就把变分法和有限维 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/unconstrained-optimization/gradient-descent\">优化理论</a> 接上了头：变分问题的离散版，本质就是多元函数求极值。当泛函是二次型（弹性、扩散等线性问题）时，方程组是线性的，系数矩阵对称正定，可用 <a href=\"../../linear-algebra/linear-equations/least-squares\">最小二乘</a> 与线性代数的成熟手段求解。Rayleigh 商极小给出本征值的上界估计，这正是 <a href=\"../constraints/lagrange-multipliers-functional\">泛函拉格朗日乘子</a> 里「乘子=本征值」的数值兑现，用来估算结构基频、量子基态能量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"galerkin-与弱形式-从泛函到方程\">Galerkin 与弱形式：从泛函到方程</h2><p>Rayleigh-Ritz 直接对泛函操作，但很多问题（尤其非自伴、无对应能量泛函的）没有现成的泛函可极小化。Galerkin 方法绕过这一点：它直接处理微分方程的弱形式。把欧拉-拉格朗日方程（或任意 PDE）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}u=f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 两端乘检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 并积分，用分部积分降低导数阶数，得到弱形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(u,v)=\\langle f,v\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 对所有检验函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 成立。再把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 都限制在同一个有限维子空间（Galerkin 选取），就得到代数方程组。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[变分问题 min J[y]&lt;br/&gt;或 PDE Lu=f&quot;] --&gt; B{有能量泛函?}&#10;  B --&gt;|有| C[Rayleigh-Ritz&lt;br/&gt;直接极小化 J[Σcᵢφᵢ]&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|未必| D[&quot;Galerkin: 弱形式&lt;br/&gt;a(u,v)=⟨f,v⟩ ∀v&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;有限维子空间&lt;br/&gt;选基函数 φᵢ&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{基函数怎么选?}&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;全局多项式/三角&quot;| G[&quot;谱方法 (高精度,规则域)&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;分片局部多项式&quot;| H[&quot;有限元 FEM&lt;br/&gt;(复杂几何主力)&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;组装刚度矩阵 K&lt;br/&gt;解 Kc=b&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[变分问题 min J[y]&lt;br/&gt;或 PDE Lu=f\"] --&gt; B{有能量泛函?}\n  B --&gt;|有| C[Rayleigh-Ritz&lt;br/&gt;直接极小化 J[Σcᵢφᵢ]\"]\n  B --&gt;|未必| D[\"Galerkin: 弱形式&lt;br/&gt;a(u,v)=⟨f,v⟩ ∀v\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"有限维子空间&lt;br/&gt;选基函数 φᵢ\"]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{基函数怎么选?}\n  F --&gt;|\"全局多项式/三角\"| G[\"谱方法 (高精度,规则域)\"]\n  F --&gt;|\"分片局部多项式\"| H[\"有限元 FEM&lt;br/&gt;(复杂几何主力)\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"组装刚度矩阵 K&lt;br/&gt;解 Kc=b\"]</pre><p>对自伴问题，Galerkin 方法与 Rayleigh-Ritz 给出完全相同的方程组——这是变分法的内在统一：极小化能量泛函 等价于 满足弱形式。弱形式还有个隐藏红利：<a href=\"../constraints/natural-boundary\">自然边界条件</a> 在弱形式里自动满足，无需显式施加，这正是有限元擅长处理自由边界的原因。弱形式与算子的严格框架来自 <a href=\"../../functional-analysis/applications/operators-pde\">泛函分析</a>（Lax-Milgram 定理保证弱解存在唯一）。</p>\n<p>两条路线的关系值得并列看清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Rayleigh-Ritz</th>\n<th>Galerkin</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出发点</td>\n<td>能量泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J[y]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>微分方程弱形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(u,v)=\\langle f,v\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要泛函</td>\n<td>是（要求问题有能量泛函）</td>\n<td>否（直接处理方程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型适用</td>\n<td>自伴、椭圆型（弹性、扩散）</td>\n<td>更广，含非自伴问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二者关系</td>\n<td>自伴问题下两者给出同一方程组</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"有限元方法-分片基函数的胜利\">有限元方法：分片基函数的胜利</h2><p>有限元方法是 Galerkin/Ritz 思想的工业级实现，它的关键创新在「基函数怎么选」。谱方法用全局光滑基（多项式、三角函数），精度极高但要求区域规则；有限元反其道而行：把求解区域剖分成大量小单元（三角形、四面体等），在每个单元上用简单的分片多项式（线性、二次）作基函数。这带来三个决定性优势。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>谱方法</th>\n<th>有限元方法 (FEM)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基函数</td>\n<td>全局光滑（多项式/三角）</td>\n<td>分片局部多项式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用区域</td>\n<td>规则（矩形、圆）</td>\n<td>任意复杂几何</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵结构</td>\n<td>稠密</td>\n<td>稀疏（局部支撑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部加密</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n<td>自然（自适应网格）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程主力领域</td>\n<td>流体湍流、量子化学</td>\n<td>结构、传热、电磁、多物理场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>局部支撑让刚度矩阵稀疏，可用稀疏求解器高效处理百万自由度；复杂几何可由网格自由贴合；误差大的地方可局部加密网格（自适应)。从悬臂梁应力到汽车碰撞、从地下水渗流到芯片散热，FEM 是默认工具。它求解的代数方程组规模巨大，依赖 <a href=\"../../differential-equations/pde-and-applications/numerical-methods\">微分方程</a> 一章讨论的数值线性代数与迭代法，二者是同一计算管线的上下游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的真实软件生态\">2026 年的真实软件生态</h2><p>变分数值方法早已是成熟的开源生态。截至 2026 年，主流有限元框架包括：FEniCS 项目的新一代 FEniCSx，最新稳定版 0.11 于 2026 年 6 月发布，由 UFL、Basix、FFCx、DOLFINx 等库组成，支持丰富的单元类型、内存并行与复数运算，其特色是让用户用接近数学弱形式的高级语言（UFL）直接书写变分问题，编译器自动生成高效求解代码（<a href=\"https://fenicsproject.org/\">fenicsproject.org</a>）；C++ 库 deal.II 的 9.7.0 版于 2025 年 7 月发布，并在 2026 年 5 月新增 step-98、step-100 教程，分别演示二维磁静态 curl-curl 问题与时谐 Helmholtz 方程的间断 Petrov-Galerkin 方法（<a href=\"https://dealii.org/\">dealii.org</a>）。此外还有 MFEM、Firedrake 等。这些工具的共同哲学，恰恰印证了本 hub 的主线：把物理问题表达为变分/弱形式，再交给离散引擎自动求解——掌握变分法，是读懂和驾驭它们的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数值变分法放弃精确解微分方程，改在有限维子空间里逼近极值，是真实工程问题的必由之路。</li>\n<li>Rayleigh-Ritz 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J[\\sum c_i\\phi_i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 化为系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的多元函数极值，与有限维 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/unconstrained-optimization/gradient-descent\">优化</a>、<a href=\"../../linear-algebra/linear-equations/least-squares\">最小二乘</a> 接轨。</li>\n<li>Galerkin 方法处理弱形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a(u,v)=\\langle f,v\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，自伴问题下与 Ritz 等价，并自动满足 <a href=\"../constraints/natural-boundary\">自然边界条件</a>。</li>\n<li>有限元用分片局部基函数，擅长复杂几何、矩阵稀疏、可自适应加密，是结构/传热/电磁的工程主力。</li>\n<li>2026 年生态：FEniCSx 0.11（2026-06）、deal.II 9.7.0（2025-07）等，哲学是「写出弱形式，引擎自动求解」，其严格底座见 <a href=\"../../functional-analysis/applications/operators-pde\">泛函分析</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值方法与有限元","id":"数值方法与有限元"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：Rayleigh-Ritz 把无穷维压成有限维","id":"核心概念-rayleigh-ritz-把无穷维压成有限维"},{"level":2,"text":"Galerkin 与弱形式：从泛函到方程","id":"galerkin-与弱形式-从泛函到方程"},{"level":2,"text":"有限元方法：分片基函数的胜利","id":"有限元方法-分片基函数的胜利"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的真实软件生态","id":"2026-年的真实软件生态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"最优控制与 Pontryagin","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/calculus-of-variations/practice/optimal-control"},"next":null}